iewed together. These unique multipart forms retain their source shape, glyph positions and priority planes at native scale. The floor mask is connected to known walking-floor cells across the entire source room and agrees across every actual placement. Enclosed matching-color pixels remain part of the feature.. A documented four-color Crystal derivative retains every original pixel coordinate, silhouette, carved glyph, doorway/stair anchor and separate native priority plane. The literal RGB-to-Crystal table, full source RGBA planes, animation-manifest identity and exact logical-cell usage are frozen independently. This is a limited-palette derivative of the named Hoenn feature, not native Crystal donor artwork. No geometry is cropped, shrunk, filled over or inferred from a generic material; collision, actors and scripted mechanics remain unchanged.",["game"]="emerald",["id"]=610,["kind"]="classic_native_geometry",["reverseGen2HoennInteriorsCompletion"]={["independent_output_sha256"]="96729ef67327f2be0b9a1b161e9a6eaf093ba4d14d9fbdb6327f35fcce756758",["named_feature"]="hoenn_ship_built_in_bunk_and_wallplate_modules",["original_feature_geometry"]=true,["pixel_scale"]=1,["reviewed_contract_sha256"]="7eba7632cf4be2f970e7c4018a5ee3f9251a1b8258e48c6674ac1b312194b5ef",["source_contexts"]={"EM_ABANDONED_SHIP_HIDDEN_FLOOR_ROOMS","EM_ABANDONED_SHIP_ROOMS2_1F","EM_ABANDONED_SHIP_ROOMS2_B1F","EM_ABANDONED_SHIP_ROOMS_1F","EM_ABANDONED_SHIP_ROOMS_B1F","EM_ABANDONED_SHIP_ROOM_B1F","EM_SS_TIDAL_ROOMS"}},["role"]="reverse_gen2_hoenn_named_hoenn_ship_built_in_bunk_and_wallplate_modules",["sourceBehavior"]=484,["sourceHash"]="b9ab9915f2737888b866a78370d135f537361ec61b0a18e4b16c16b3f0d1b2e9",["status"]="reviewed",["style"]="gen2",["tileset"]="general__inside_ship"},
